==Battleground==
*4 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*6 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nana & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Just like the [[Industrial Town Siaogang Station|previous stage]], this one is also easy to beat. Bring any [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]], as they work well here. Even [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Dark Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] can beat this on their own.

